WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:03.850
Thank you for your time.

00:04.620 --> 00:07.230
My name is Linus. I'm from 
the Kingdom of Remlest.

00:07.480 --> 00:11.470
<i>The Kingdom of Remlest is a neighbor 
of the Kingdom of Valschein.</i>

00:11.900 --> 00:16.440
<i>It's close to the domain of Margrave 
Ashbatten, where Patrick's family lives.</i>

00:17.210 --> 00:21.000
<i>I've heard that the two kingdoms 
don't get along very well.</i>

00:21.210 --> 00:24.590
<i>What could a spy from there want with me?</i>

00:25.780 --> 00:27.880
Please, order whatever you'd like.

00:31.940 --> 00:34.020
I'll have the offal stew, then.

00:34.020 --> 00:35.200
Offal stew?

00:35.610 --> 00:39.000
It's pre-made, so it should 
be brought out quickly.

00:39.340 --> 00:42.520
I can't be out too late 
or I'll break curfew.

00:42.520 --> 00:44.410
F-Fair enough...

01:09.270 --> 01:12.920
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

01:09.690 --> 01:12.920
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

02:15.250 --> 02:20.010
<b>The Hidden Boss Is Solicited by an Enemy Nation</b>

02:22.610 --> 02:25.240
I've been stationed in this 
kingdom for a long time now,

02:25.600 --> 02:29.000
so I've known about you since 
you enrolled at the academy.

02:29.460 --> 02:32.500
After gathering intel about 
you and doing some research...

02:32.500 --> 02:36.010
<i>Research? I'm not a newly discovered species.</i>

02:36.650 --> 02:41.010
I've concluded that bringing you 
into my kingdom would be difficult.

02:41.450 --> 02:44.190
You don't seem interested in 
things like status or wealth,

02:44.190 --> 02:48.270
and even if, for some reason, you 
decided to leave this kingdom,

02:48.490 --> 02:51.020
you'd have no reason to relocate to mine.

02:52.090 --> 02:55.190
Then why reach out to me now?

02:55.670 --> 02:58.090
Because my country doesn't agree with me.

02:58.090 --> 03:00.870
After the incident that resulted 
in you acquiring a dragon,

03:00.870 --> 03:03.200
they just won't stay quiet any longer.

03:05.230 --> 03:08.960
All they ever do is order me around.

03:08.960 --> 03:11.710
They don't understand how 
tough my job is at all.

03:11.710 --> 03:14.730
Um... Allow me to commend your efforts.

03:14.730 --> 03:16.580
Let me ask you this, just for the record:

03:16.910 --> 03:18.950
Would you come to Remlest?

03:18.950 --> 03:21.720
If there's anything you want, 
I'll see that you get it.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.680
And what do they want from me in return?

03:23.680 --> 03:25.720
For you to become a civilian 
soldier, most likely.

03:25.720 --> 03:28.770
<i>That would make me an enemy of this kingdom.</i>

03:29.170 --> 03:30.730
<i>And if war breaks out,</i>

03:31.150 --> 03:33.850
<i>it'll take place in Margrave 
Ashbatten's domain.</i>

03:34.920 --> 03:36.230
I will not.

03:36.230 --> 03:38.230
That's what I thought.

03:38.230 --> 03:42.200
There's one thing I'd like to 
know, purely out of curiosity.

03:42.200 --> 03:43.240
What's that?

03:43.640 --> 03:46.620
Your reason for staying in this kingdom.

03:47.310 --> 03:50.630
I know discrimination against those 
with black hair runs deep here.

03:53.490 --> 03:56.710
So I can defeat the Demon Lord. 
He threatens the entire world.

03:57.040 --> 04:01.130
What? If the Demon Lord attacks, 
wouldn't it just be this kingdom?

04:01.450 --> 04:02.970
What do you...

04:03.800 --> 04:05.470
Looks like our time is up.

04:05.470 --> 04:06.360
Huh?

04:07.350 --> 04:10.140
Someone is about to barge 
into this establishment.

04:10.140 --> 04:12.480
Probably this kingdom's soldiers.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.600
I think they had someone watching me.

04:16.700 --> 04:18.360
There's still time for you to escape.

04:18.610 --> 04:21.110
Understood. I owe you one for this.

04:29.880 --> 04:30.980
This is the room!

04:33.260 --> 04:34.540
Damn it!

04:38.170 --> 04:41.630
<i>I didn't get to do the shopping 
I wanted to do for Ryu,</i>

04:41.920 --> 04:43.920
<i>but I did learn some things.</i>

04:46.140 --> 04:49.160
<i>Like how our neighboring kingdom sees me,</i>

04:49.750 --> 04:54.020
<i>and that the Demon Lord will only attack 
this kingdom, which is new information.</i>

04:54.360 --> 04:57.040
<i>And that, until some time ago,</i>

04:57.040 --> 05:00.210
<i>I might have fled this kingdom if 
things got to be such a hassle,</i>

05:00.530 --> 05:04.030
<i>but now I don't want to leave.</i>

05:04.630 --> 05:07.530
<i>And I want to become his enemy even less.</i>

05:07.890 --> 05:12.490
<i>What happened today made me realize 
how I feel about Patrick...</i>

05:13.650 --> 05:15.290
<i>Or so I thought, but...</i>

05:15.900 --> 05:18.290
Maybe I was mistaken after all.

05:18.290 --> 05:20.290
Mistaken about what?

05:20.780 --> 05:22.900
Let's say there's a girl

05:22.900 --> 05:26.090
attending a school somewhere 
that doesn't have many students,

05:26.520 --> 05:29.580
and she has no friends in her own grade.

05:30.300 --> 05:32.740
But around the start of her second year,

05:32.740 --> 05:37.810
she met a kind boy who would help her 
study and listen when she needed to talk.

05:37.810 --> 05:38.860
Huh?

05:39.590 --> 05:43.850
I think she'd be likely to mistake 
friendly love for romantic love.

05:43.850 --> 05:45.890
That's what I'm going through right now.

05:45.890 --> 05:47.450
What in the world are you talking about?

05:47.750 --> 05:50.230
Well... how should I put it?

05:51.380 --> 05:55.480
I'm talking about wanting 
to be friends with you.

05:56.270 --> 05:59.460
Haven't we been friends all this time?

06:00.060 --> 06:03.170
I thought of you as my friend.

06:03.170 --> 06:06.840
<i>Wh-What was with that 
"I'm a dreamboat on the inside" line?!</i>

06:06.840 --> 06:10.110
<i>That paired with his looks is making 
him seem like the perfect hottie!</i>

06:10.110 --> 06:10.930
<i>Wait, no!</i>

06:11.190 --> 06:13.680
<i>There's no way anyone like 
that can really exist!</i>

06:13.680 --> 06:15.050
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

06:15.050 --> 06:19.980
<i>Maybe he thinks of me as a valuable combat 
asset if we go to war with Remlest!</i>

06:20.970 --> 06:25.100
I-I'm not going to invade 
Remlest or anything!

06:25.100 --> 06:26.440
Right, Ryu?

06:27.140 --> 06:27.940
Huh?

06:27.940 --> 06:31.870
If we go to war, I wouldn't mind 
helping our defensive line, but...

06:32.430 --> 06:35.000
You've got some serious trust issues, huh?

06:35.540 --> 06:38.710
I'm sure the people around you 
haven't helped that, though...

06:38.980 --> 06:41.140
It's embarrassing to come 
out and say it like this,

06:41.450 --> 06:44.050
but I would never try to use 
your strength like that.

06:44.370 --> 06:47.590
You'd probably run away from me if I did,

06:47.960 --> 06:50.510
and I don't want to do that, anyway.

06:51.530 --> 06:56.350
Even if you were level 1, 
I'd still stand by your side.

06:58.320 --> 06:59.850
Thank you...

07:00.390 --> 07:04.170
But one person alone can level 
up more efficiently than two.

07:04.170 --> 07:07.350
I never said anything about 
leveling up together...

07:12.930 --> 07:14.990
They posted the results of our midterms.

07:14.990 --> 07:16.910
You're near the top again, I see.

07:17.180 --> 07:20.910
So are you. You <i>can</i> study, I guess.

07:21.210 --> 07:25.170
<i>I wish he wouldn't say that as 
if studying is all I can do.</i>

07:26.200 --> 07:29.450
I guess it's nice of them to not 
post every student's results.

07:29.450 --> 07:34.550
There's be trouble if everyone thought the 
heir to some powerful noble was an idiot.

07:34.850 --> 07:36.560
Miss Yumiella!

07:36.790 --> 07:37.980
Yikes. It's her.

07:39.830 --> 07:43.310
I'd like to talk to you! 
It's extremely important!

07:44.580 --> 07:45.560
Make-up exam?

07:45.810 --> 07:51.450
Yes. Could you help me study 
so I can pass the make-up exam?

07:51.450 --> 07:54.000
Oh, I said that wrong!

07:54.430 --> 07:57.200
I meant I wouldn't mind 
letting you help me study.

07:57.480 --> 08:00.510
Did you do poorly on the midterms?

08:00.970 --> 08:03.430
Why don't you ask your 
friends there for help?

08:04.360 --> 08:06.310
That just won't do.

08:06.310 --> 08:09.170
I got the highest score of us all.

08:09.170 --> 08:10.980
<i>That's totally a lie.</i>

08:10.980 --> 08:13.280
<i>They're just trying to 
make Eleonora feel better.</i>

08:15.090 --> 08:18.350
Fine, I'll do it. You just want 
me to help you study, right?

08:18.350 --> 08:19.560
Yes!

08:19.560 --> 08:23.690
There aren't many people 
who can teach me, you know!

08:24.950 --> 08:27.980
Again, the third king was Silas.

08:27.980 --> 08:31.180
What? Then what about the one named Douglas?

08:31.180 --> 08:32.740
He was the second king.

08:32.740 --> 08:36.530
<i>This girl is devastatingly 
unfit for studying.</i>

08:36.530 --> 08:40.740
<i>All of these points could be memorized, 
but she's even terrible at memorization.</i>

08:41.130 --> 08:42.790
Oh, that's right.

08:42.790 --> 08:48.240
The current king has a cousin 
whose name is Douglas,

08:48.240 --> 08:50.250
so I got them mixed up.

08:50.490 --> 08:54.170
So you can handle recent 
history, then, Miss Eleonora?

08:54.410 --> 08:56.180
Of course!

08:56.180 --> 08:59.760
It involves Prince Edwin's father 
and his relatives, after all!

08:59.760 --> 09:03.070
<i>So she can memorize things she's 
interested in with no trouble.</i>

09:03.460 --> 09:08.770
<i>Come to think of it, her knowledge of 
teas and perfumes is pretty impressive.</i>

09:09.360 --> 09:14.780
Oh, in that case, why not memorize these 
things by connecting them to Prince Edwin?

09:14.780 --> 09:19.120
King Silas was Prince Edwin's 
grandfather's grandfather.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.560
He was?!

09:20.560 --> 09:23.540
I mean, that's how royal families work.

09:23.540 --> 09:26.560
<i>Her perception of things is 
off is all kinds of ways.</i>

09:27.390 --> 09:31.780
Who successfully implemented large-scale 
irrigation in the town of Matlock?

09:31.780 --> 09:35.040
That was Prince Edwin's great-grandfather's 
younger brother, so...

09:35.040 --> 09:36.550
Cliff!

09:36.830 --> 09:40.550
Who opened up the Giem region 
and brought agriculture there?

09:41.050 --> 09:44.330
That was Prince Edwin's 
grandmother's uncle, so...

09:44.730 --> 09:46.310
Andrew!

09:47.140 --> 09:48.310
Perfect.

09:48.570 --> 09:49.920
Thank you!

09:49.920 --> 09:52.120
I couldn't have done it without you!

09:52.120 --> 09:54.810
Let's study together for the next exam, too!

09:58.240 --> 10:02.010
Oh, so Miss Eleonora passed 
the make-up exam, then?

10:02.010 --> 10:03.200
Good for her.

10:03.480 --> 10:04.340
Yes,

10:04.340 --> 10:08.610
but it's depressing that I might have to 
give her private lessons until we graduate.

10:10.330 --> 10:12.970
Patrick, are you free after this?

10:13.370 --> 10:17.220
I'd like to try flying with 
Ryu again. Would you join me?

10:17.220 --> 10:19.240
Sorry. I have something to do.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.810
Listen...

10:20.810 --> 10:24.970
Can't you tell me what it is you're 
doing after school and on days off?

10:24.970 --> 10:26.730
Miss Yumiella!

10:26.970 --> 10:28.730
Ugh. Her again.

10:30.380 --> 10:32.730
To thank you for helping me study,

10:32.730 --> 10:34.660
I brought you a present!

10:35.230 --> 10:37.470
I'm sure it'll look lovely on you!

10:39.010 --> 10:40.590
Wait, Patrick!

10:41.300 --> 10:44.280
Have a good time with Miss Eleonora. See ya.

10:48.990 --> 10:50.370
You're back again?

10:50.630 --> 10:52.490
Don't overdo it, you hear?

10:52.490 --> 10:54.130
I need to get stronger.

10:54.410 --> 10:56.850
So you can battle a romantic 
rival or something?

10:57.180 --> 10:58.260
No...

10:58.680 --> 11:00.380
Not a rival.

11:00.380 --> 11:02.170
She's the one who's strong.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.190
Huh?

11:08.990 --> 11:12.770
I'm only into people who 
are stronger than me.

11:13.610 --> 11:15.520
<i>I might never make it to level 99,</i>

11:16.210 --> 11:18.410
<i>but to get as close as 
I can to where she is...</i>

11:20.650 --> 11:22.530
<i>I have to do everything I can!</i>

11:24.880 --> 11:28.660
<i>Seriously... Why did I have to fall for her?</i>

11:28.940 --> 11:32.550
<i>No matter how powerful she is, 
Yumiella's just a regular person.</i>

11:32.860 --> 11:34.920
<i>She needs someone to be there for her.</i>

11:35.210 --> 11:37.920
<i>She's just a normal 
sixteen-year-old, like me.</i>

11:38.790 --> 11:39.550
<i>Normal...</i>

11:40.880 --> 11:44.260
<i>Wait... Is she?</i>

11:45.220 --> 11:47.130
<i>It's no use. I just don't know.</i>

11:50.810 --> 11:51.800
Patrick!

11:57.640 --> 11:58.780
Welcome back.

11:59.420 --> 12:01.210
You're injured again.

12:02.950 --> 12:04.780
No need to worry about me.

12:04.780 --> 12:09.040
More importantly, take Ryu home 
before he causes a commotion.

12:09.290 --> 12:14.170
Patrick, I found out where 
you've been going all the time.

12:15.130 --> 12:16.780
You figured me out, huh?

12:16.780 --> 12:18.400
Yeah, it's true... I've...

12:18.400 --> 12:20.090
What's she like?

12:20.410 --> 12:21.210
"She"?

12:21.450 --> 12:24.600
Your girlfriend. The person you're dating.

12:24.600 --> 12:27.800
You've been going out every day 
on dates with her, haven't you?

12:28.640 --> 12:30.900
I guess she gets violent when she's angry.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.480
That's why you're always so injured.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.090
You're completely wrong!

12:34.090 --> 12:36.450
I don't have a girlfriend outside the school!

12:36.840 --> 12:38.780
Then she's a student here?

12:38.780 --> 12:41.120
You come back at different times on purpose?

12:41.120 --> 12:44.200
Wow... People actually do that?

12:44.470 --> 12:47.090
What even gave you that idea?

12:47.090 --> 12:49.110
I don't have a girlfriend!

12:49.110 --> 12:52.580
Do these really look like the kind of 
injuries a girlfriend would give me?

12:52.580 --> 12:54.960
You don't? So... what, then?

12:56.150 --> 12:57.290
Well...

12:58.940 --> 13:01.600
Oh, sorry for ignoring you, Ryu.

13:01.600 --> 13:03.870
I'm going to take Ryu home now.

13:05.970 --> 13:06.980
Bye.

13:09.890 --> 13:11.990
She hasn't even considered 
me at all, has she?

13:12.630 --> 13:13.730
Ashbatten.

13:14.540 --> 13:15.780
Prince Edwin!

13:16.250 --> 13:18.760
I'm here a bit ahead of 
the time we agreed on,

13:18.760 --> 13:21.630
but I saw her riding on that dragon.

13:21.980 --> 13:24.490
I heard everything.

13:24.490 --> 13:27.430
She is a bit strange, for sure,

13:27.430 --> 13:29.490
but you might be right.

13:36.290 --> 13:37.210
Hey, Ryu...

13:37.680 --> 13:41.210
Where do you think Patrick goes every day?

13:42.920 --> 13:46.370
You're right. I'd be out trying to level up,

13:46.370 --> 13:49.090
but I shouldn't assume he's like me.

13:50.720 --> 13:55.740
Yes. While I was listening to Eleonora talk 
about how much she loves Prince Edwin,

13:55.740 --> 13:58.620
it made me think that this 
might really be love.

13:59.000 --> 14:02.610
This is the world of an 
otome game, after all.

14:03.140 --> 14:05.860
There'd be nothing strange 
about him having a girlfriend.

14:07.930 --> 14:09.970
Thank you for trying to cheer me up.

14:09.970 --> 14:12.490
But when I worked up the 
courage to ask him...

14:12.810 --> 14:14.790
I don't have a girlfriend!

14:19.920 --> 14:24.430
I was a bit... no, I was 
really happy to hear that.

14:27.370 --> 14:29.430
There's someone I want you to meet with.

14:29.430 --> 14:31.030
What? Who?

14:31.540 --> 14:32.800
Prince Edwin.

14:35.190 --> 14:37.900
He's waiting to see you 
in the principal's office.

14:39.700 --> 14:41.940
Thank you for coming, Miss Yumiella.

14:42.230 --> 14:44.480
Good work, Ashbatten.

14:51.460 --> 14:52.450
Sit down.

14:55.070 --> 14:57.730
Um... What did you want to talk about?

15:00.240 --> 15:01.460
I'm sorry.

15:01.690 --> 15:02.410
Huh?

15:03.250 --> 15:06.150
I've been rude to you ever 
since the entrance ceremony.

15:06.610 --> 15:08.950
My assumptions were wrong and improper.

15:08.950 --> 15:10.720
I let my senseless 
pride get the better of me.

15:11.400 --> 15:16.970
My father told me there's no way 
you could be the Demon Lord...

15:17.460 --> 15:22.480
But I just couldn't admit my 
own mistake before my peers.

15:23.300 --> 15:27.590
My own immaturity caused so 
much unpleasantness for you,

15:28.040 --> 15:29.490
and I am sorry for that.

15:30.150 --> 15:32.730
<i>Well, he is still a child.</i>

15:33.230 --> 15:37.500
<i>Not just him. All the other students 
here are still teenagers, too.</i>

15:37.500 --> 15:40.190
<i>Mentally, they all have a childish side.</i>

15:40.520 --> 15:42.750
<i>They all have their senseless 
vanity and pride.</i>

15:43.090 --> 15:47.470
<i>Those disliked by the central figures 
in a class are snubbed by everyone.</i>

15:47.850 --> 15:49.930
<i>What I'm going through now</i>

15:49.930 --> 15:53.660
<i>is something I could just as easily 
have experienced in my previous life.</i>

15:54.420 --> 15:58.720
I'm happy to hear you say that, but 
why the sudden change of heart?

15:59.060 --> 16:01.060
Ashbatten talked to me.

16:01.060 --> 16:02.560
Patrick?

16:02.790 --> 16:04.990
He offered a new perspective.

16:05.310 --> 16:09.820
He's told me several 
stories about you of late.

16:10.170 --> 16:12.090
He said that your strength is the result

16:12.090 --> 16:16.330
of an amount of effort that none 
of us could ever hope to match.

16:16.730 --> 16:18.830
He also told me what you've 
been like most recently,

16:18.830 --> 16:22.340
and I understood that you're 
really just a regular person.

16:23.610 --> 16:27.770
I baselessly believed that no one 
had put in more effort than me,

16:28.130 --> 16:31.520
and somewhere inside, I was afraid of you,

16:31.520 --> 16:34.130
because I thought you were 
something that wasn't normal.

16:34.510 --> 16:36.460
This has turned into nothing but excuses...

16:36.960 --> 16:40.770
I realize it's selfish to ask, 
but could you forgive me?

16:40.770 --> 16:42.740
I understand.

16:43.230 --> 16:47.150
I was already well aware that 
my existence defies all logic,

16:47.510 --> 16:49.520
so I accept your apology.

16:49.520 --> 16:50.920
Oh, good.

16:51.720 --> 16:53.890
I'd like to make it up to you somehow.

16:53.890 --> 16:56.160
Is there anything I can do?

16:56.600 --> 16:59.480
If you'll allow me to join you 
in slaying the Demon Lord,

16:59.480 --> 17:01.160
that's more than enough.

17:02.090 --> 17:04.330
Ashbatten was right.

17:04.910 --> 17:07.560
Oh, actually, I do have one request.

17:07.970 --> 17:12.420
Could you tell me what Patrick said about me?

17:12.860 --> 17:16.430
He said you have no interest in 
things like power and wealth,

17:16.640 --> 17:20.490
and that you're too strong to let 
a bad reputation bring you down.

17:20.490 --> 17:23.100
Also, that you're basically a good person.

17:23.100 --> 17:25.440
"Basically"? What does that mean?

17:25.970 --> 17:28.590
That you're crazy, you act like a nutcase,

17:28.590 --> 17:30.870
and everything you do is questionable,

17:30.870 --> 17:33.680
but you're good-natured 
and simple-minded...

17:34.400 --> 17:37.570
I didn't say all this! He did!

17:37.810 --> 17:40.740
I thought I should answer 
your question honestly...

17:40.740 --> 17:42.080
You know, tell the truth!

17:42.080 --> 17:44.570
<i>He gets all conscientious 
about the strangest things.</i>

17:44.570 --> 17:49.210
<i>Then again, I guess I sort of 
knew Patrick saw me that way.</i>

17:51.850 --> 17:53.960
How did your talk with him go?

17:54.240 --> 17:56.300
He seemed like a different person.

17:56.300 --> 17:58.340
That wasn't a double of 
him or something, was it?

17:58.690 --> 18:01.350
He's just been a little off 
since the entrance ceremony.

18:01.350 --> 18:04.850
Prince Edwin is actually a 
very understanding young man.

18:05.310 --> 18:08.870
I'm relieved that he's finally 
come to his senses, too.

18:08.870 --> 18:10.830
All thanks to Patrick, eh?

18:10.830 --> 18:12.610
Yes, it truly is.

18:12.880 --> 18:16.540
His Highness wouldn't 
listen to me or the king,

18:16.540 --> 18:18.750
but he was so receptive to him.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.870
Because they're the same age, perhaps?

18:20.870 --> 18:23.250
<i>I think it's more than that.</i>

18:23.250 --> 18:27.870
<i>Patrick's sincerity must have 
gotten through to Edwin.</i>

18:28.620 --> 18:34.380
I think this has finally set the 
stage for you to help them level up.

18:34.380 --> 18:36.230
If it's necessary.

18:36.230 --> 18:39.630
His Highness and his friends 
haven't raised their levels, then?

18:39.950 --> 18:42.140
Well, about that...

18:42.700 --> 18:46.140
Ever since you trounced them at last 
year's martial arts competition,

18:46.590 --> 18:51.150
both William and Oswald have grown even 
more enthusiastic about leveling up.

18:51.530 --> 18:53.650
So has Prince Edwin, of course.

18:54.280 --> 18:57.080
The problem is Miss Alicia.

18:57.550 --> 19:00.580
The three of them always 
end up protecting her,

19:00.580 --> 19:02.910
so she can't raise her own level.

19:03.590 --> 19:05.410
It's troubling her, as well.

19:05.980 --> 19:08.410
She's training on her own 
as we speak, I believe.

19:11.820 --> 19:15.150
<i>It's great that Edwin had 
a change of attitude,</i>

19:15.150 --> 19:19.410
<i>but I'd still prefer to avoid getting 
involved with them too much.</i>

19:25.850 --> 19:29.760
<i>Alicia's level remaining so 
low is a problem, though.</i>

19:29.760 --> 19:31.610
<i>I'll give her some support,</i>

19:31.610 --> 19:34.980
<i>but I want her to be the one 
who kills the Demon Lord.</i>

19:35.530 --> 19:38.970
<i>Otherwise, I might be forced to marry Edwin.</i>

19:40.810 --> 19:41.980
Miss Alicia?

19:43.160 --> 19:47.960
<i>It seems I still look like 
a monster in her eyes.</i>

19:49.120 --> 19:52.870
I-It's you, Miss Yumiella? Can I help you?

19:53.620 --> 19:56.490
You seem to be going to 
great pains to level up.

19:56.830 --> 20:00.630
Would you like to go to a dungeon 
in the town of Varias with me?

20:00.630 --> 20:02.630
A d-dungeon?

20:02.930 --> 20:03.820
Yes.

20:03.820 --> 20:06.550
The one in Varias is a 
dark-attribute dungeon,

20:06.550 --> 20:11.890
so with your light magic, you should be 
able to level up even more efficiently.

20:11.890 --> 20:14.180
A dark-attribute dungeon...

20:14.910 --> 20:16.890
with just me and Miss Yumiella?

20:17.860 --> 20:21.370
I-I'm sorry! I appreciate the invitation,

20:21.370 --> 20:23.810
but I don't think I'm ready for that!

20:23.810 --> 20:25.200
I have to go now!

20:26.500 --> 20:28.230
<i>She ran away from me.</i>

20:28.230 --> 20:30.240
<i>But if she'd actually try it,</i>

20:30.240 --> 20:33.750
<i>I think she'd realize how 
much fun leveling up is, too.</i>

20:36.420 --> 20:38.900
She hasn't been seen since yesterday evening.

20:38.900 --> 20:43.170
She didn't come to breakfast, so 
the dorm head went to check on her,

20:43.170 --> 20:45.300
and she was nowhere to be found.

20:45.300 --> 20:48.050
Maybe she felt homesick and went home?

20:48.050 --> 20:51.700
But she left all of her clothes 
and other things behind.

20:51.700 --> 20:53.890
Patrick, what's going on?

20:53.890 --> 20:56.040
Apparently, Miss Alicia's gone missing.

20:56.040 --> 20:56.670
What?

20:56.670 --> 21:00.730
Prince Edwin and the teachers 
are all out searching for her.

21:00.730 --> 21:01.870
Miss Yumiella!

21:02.430 --> 21:05.410
Alicia is gone! Do you know anything?

21:05.410 --> 21:06.950
I have no idea.

21:07.160 --> 21:09.330
Is that true? You're not lying, are you?

21:09.330 --> 21:10.860
It's true.

21:10.860 --> 21:14.710
I heard she was troubled because she wasn't 
gaining any levels, but that's all.

21:14.920 --> 21:18.330
Could it be that she was so 
troubled that she ran away?

21:18.570 --> 21:22.920
Alicia isn't that weak!
You know that as well as we do!

21:23.520 --> 21:27.560
Even if she had a reason,
I'd think she would have left a note.

21:27.970 --> 21:30.310
So we wouldn't worry about her.

21:30.310 --> 21:34.080
You're right. She's considerate 
enough to do that.

21:34.080 --> 21:36.120
That's why I keep telling you

21:36.120 --> 21:38.190
that someone must have kidnapped her!

21:38.190 --> 21:39.560
Kidnapped?

21:39.850 --> 21:42.600
She's our trump card for 
defeating the Demon Lord.

21:42.970 --> 21:46.060
If there's some force out there 
that supports the Demon Lord,

21:46.060 --> 21:50.580
it makes sense that they'd want to get 
rid of her before she can grow powerful.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.880
Let's split up and look for her again!

21:52.880 --> 21:53.640
Right!

21:55.600 --> 21:57.580
This has gotten pretty big.
